Package: rsfgseaR
Title: Fgsea-Compatible Rust Preranked Gene Set Enrichment in R
Version: 0.3.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Denis", "Demin", email = "denisdeminbio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Denis Demin [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Denis Demin <denisdeminbio@gmail.com>
Description: Provides an R interface to 'rsfgsea', a high-performance Rust
    implementation of fgsea-compatible preranked Gene Set Enrichment Analysis.
    Supports wrapper-style fgsea execution, fixed-permutation simple mode, and
    multilevel mode with results returned in a familiar fgsea-style tabular
    shape.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.96.0)
URL: https://github.com/deminden/rsfgsea
BugReports: https://github.com/deminden/rsfgsea/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
